# MMD JS Viewer
> fillColor=`#031A31`,mmd.emoticon=`plugin`,textColor=`#FFFFFF`,topicLinkUID=`rootTopic`


- NOTE
<pre>This page is a browser viewer for Scia Reto MMD mind maps.

Drag the canvas to pan, use the mouse wheel to zoom, and double-click a topic to read its note.</pre>

## Navigation
> fillColor=`#B1BFCC`,leftSide=`true`,mmd.emoticon=`compass`


### Pan and zoom
> fillColor=`#FDFDFD`

- NOTE
<pre>Drag the map to pan, including from a topic.
A short click still selects.
Mouse wheel zooms toward the cursor.
Toolbar Fit recenters the whole map.
Pinch-zoom works on touch screens.</pre>


### Keyboard
> fillColor=`#FDFDFD`

- NOTE
<pre>Arrow keys move among visible topics.
Home selects the root.
- folds a branch, + unfolds it.
Alt+- / Alt+= fold or unfold all descendants.
Ctrl/Cmd +/- zoom, Ctrl/Cmd 0 fits.</pre>


### Collapse
> collapsed=`true`,fillColor=`#FDFDFD`,mmd.emoticon=`lock`

- NOTE
<pre>Click the small circle on a topic to hide or show children. This branch starts folded.</pre>


#### Hidden child
> fillColor=`#99FFCC`

- NOTE
<pre>Unfold the parent to see this topic again.</pre>


## Notes and extras
> fillColor=`#7AA3E5`,mmd.emoticon=`legend`


### Plain note
> fillColor=`#99FFCC`

- NOTE
<pre>Topic notes are stored as extra NOTE blocks in the MMD file.

They can be several lines
and still round-trip through the Java editors.</pre>


