## Attach to a page
> fillColor=`#B1BFCC`,leftSide=`true`,mmd.emoticon=`application`


### Script tag
> fillColor=`#FDFDFD`,mmd.emoticon=`code`

- NOTE
<pre>Include mmd-viewer.css and mmd-viewer.js, then call MmdViewer.attach(element, { src: "map.mmd" }).</pre>


### Auto mount
> fillColor=`#FDFDFD`

- NOTE
<pre>Place data-mmd-viewer and data-mmd-src on any element. The library mounts on DOMContentLoaded.</pre>
